      "message": "I am surprised we don\u0027t allow : for the password \"p@ss:word!123\" \nThis is probably here due to basic auth.. But even so.. I would think disallowing for the username would be enough. Oh well.",
      "revId": "1b31bf007003508e8de8c054f059d6d27ccf9e57",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
